              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "intro-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Full-service commercial truck dealerships you can count on.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "Welcome to Rechtien Truck Group"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien Truck Group are full-service commercial truck dealerships. We sell, service and support new and pre-owned trucks — medium, heavy and severe service International® trucks and Hino trucks, plus IC Bus and Mitsubishi FUSO medium duty work trucks through Rechtien Truck Group — with parts, service, maintenance and repair support behind every sale.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We are more than authorized International® truck dealers. Rechtien's product lines also include Ottawa trucks, East, Pitts and Dorsey trailers and forklifts, and Rechtien Truck Group Idealease provides trucks for lease and rental supported by mobile maintenance services.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you are ready to invest in a new truck, trailer or forklift, our friendly and knowledgeable sales, financing, service and parts departments are prepared to make your experience outstanding — from helping you make your choice to ongoing maintenance and customization. We move our customers forward with innovative products backed by quality service.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-cta",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "explore-inventory"
                      }
                    ],
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                }
