                      {
                        "label": "1981 · Rechtien Truck Group",
                        "desc": "Our South Florida dealership was founded in 1981 and has more than 40 years of experience serving South Florida, with an established presence in Miami and the surrounding South Florida markets."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "1992 · Rechtien Truck Group",
                        "desc": "Our South Carolina dealership was founded in 1992 by Dick Ryan. Built on the hard work of its employees and on customers who keep challenging it to find new transportation solutions, it grew into the largest commercial truck dealer in South Carolina, with six locations."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "May 2022 · The acquisition",
                        "desc": "In May 2022 the South Florida and South Carolina dealerships came together as Rechtien Truck Group, bringing two International dealerships with long histories in their markets together."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Today · 11 locations",
                        "desc": "The acquisition expanded the dealership network to 11 locations across South Florida and South Carolina — five in South Florida and six in South Carolina."
