                },
                {
                  "id": "owner-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Today's transportation industry demands more than just providing tough, dependable, medium and heavy-duty trucks. It demands comprehensive service and a parts inventory that keeps downtime to a minimum and keeps you on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "owner-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Since Rechtien Truck Group's inception in 1992, our business philosophy has been one of complete service for all your business needs. You can expect a professional, knowledgeable staff that is capable of meeting your business needs. We are not only dedicated to exceeding customers' expectations — we are here to deliver transportation solutions for all your business needs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
