                {
                  "id": "glance-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "11 dealership locations across South Florida and South Carolina.\n\nMore than four decades of experience in South Florida, since 1981.\n\nA history since 1992 as the largest commercial truck dealer in South Carolina.\n\nComprehensive truck sales and service for medium, heavy and severe service trucks.\n\nMultiple commercial vehicle brands: International®, Hino, IC Bus and Mitsubishi FUSO, plus Ottawa trucks and East, Pitts and Dorsey trailers.\n\nParts and maintenance support, including more than 130 service bays and mobile maintenance services at Rechtien Truck Group.\n\nLeasing and rental options, including Idealease at Rechtien Truck Group.\n\nExperienced dealership teams — our South Carolina dealerships alone have more than 270 employees.\n\nCoverage across South Florida and South Carolina.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "glance-copy",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 7
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "glance-copy-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One dealership network for South Florida and South Carolina.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "glance-copy-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In May 2022 the South Florida and South Carolina dealerships came together as Rechtien Truck Group. Together the two International dealerships serve customers across South Florida and South Carolina through a network of 11 locations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "glance-copy-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In South Carolina, Rechtien Truck Group has been one of the region's premier dealers for more than 30 years, with a presence covering the entire state. In South Florida, it brings more than 40 years of experience serving South Florida.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "glance-copy-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Both teams share the same approach: build long-term relationships by giving customers the best service available, keep downtime to a minimum, and deliver transportation solutions for all your business needs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
